WEBVTT

00:14:29.034 --> 00:14:32.104
mnogo će vas zaboleti.

00:14:33.007 --> 00:14:35.077
Stoga, to su mnogi razlozi

00:14:35.077 --> 00:14:37.028
zbog kojih nećete uspeti

00:14:37.028 --> 00:14:40.047
da ostvarite sjajnu karijeru,

00:14:41.332 --> 00:14:43.587
osim ako...

00:14:46.487 --> 00:14:48.477
Osim ako.

00:14:50.102 --> 00:14:53.552
Hvala vam. (Aplauz)